## Fertility Control
In the base game, using specialized industry like farms depletes the terrain fertility, it can't regenerate fast enough for continous use.

This mod adds settings to increase the fertility by a set value. It also allows to make ore and oil regenerate.
		
### Features
- Restore all fertility of the map (fertility, ore, oil)
- Deplete all fertility of the map (fertility, ore, oil)
- Automatically restore fertility over time, with a slider to control the speed of regeneration
- Enable automatic restoration of ore and oil over time, which only exists in Easy Mode per default
		
